{start_of_verse: 2}
Every [G]step[**] is getting [G7]brighter[**] as the [C]golden[**] stairs I [G]climb[**]
Every [C]burden's[**] getting [G]lighter[**], every [A7]cloud[**] is silver-[D]lined[**]
There the [G]sun[**] is always [G7]shining[**], there no [C]tear[**] will dim the [G]eye[**]
At the [C]ending[**] of the [G]rainbow[**] where the [D]mountains[**] touch the [G]sky[**].
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: 3}
I don't [G]know[**] about to[G7]morrow[**], it may [C]bring[**] me pover[G]ty[**]
But the [C]one[**] who feeds the [G]sparrow[**] is the [A7]one[**] who stands by [D]me[**]
And the [G]path[**] that is my [G7]portion[**] may be [C]through[**] the flame or [G]flood[**]
